  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKACT Phase 3 - Crown Prosecution Service (POCD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Crown Prosecution Service Proceeds of Crime Division supports ODA eligible countries to recover funds from their countries that have been stolen and hidden in other jurisdictions and are the proceeds of corruption cases.  Following convictions in the UK these funds are typically returned to the ODA eligible country which are the programme beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
